# CTF / Security Testing
# Flags and solutions (keep local only)
**/flag.txt
**/flags.txt
**/solution.txt
**/credentials.txt
**/secrets.txt

# Session files and tokens
**/session_*.md
**/*_session.json
**/*.token

# Malicious payloads (keep local only)
**/shell.php
**/shell.jsp
**/shell.aspx
**/webshell.*
**/*.evil.*

# XXE/XSS test files
**/xxe_payload.xml
**/xss_payload.html

